          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>What will be the output of the below code?</p><pre><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">Main</span>()</span>\n{\n    <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">int</span>[] arr = {<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>};\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span>{\n        Console.Write(arr[<span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>]);\n    }\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span>(Exception ex){\n        Console.WriteLine(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Error occurred!&quot;</span>);\n    }\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span>(IndexOutOfRangeException ex){\n        Console.WriteLine(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Index error occurred!&quot;</span>);\n    }\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span>(NullReferenceException ex){\n        Console.WriteLine(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Null error occurred!&quot;</span>);\n    }\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Đoạn mã dưới đây sẽ cho kết quả gì?</p><pre><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">Main</span>()</span>\n{\n    <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">int</span>[] arr = {<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>};\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span>{\n        Console.Write(arr[<span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>]);\n    }\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span>(Exception ex){\n        Console.WriteLine(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Error occurred!&quot;</span>);\n    }\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span>(IndexOutOfRangeException ex){\n        Console.WriteLine(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Index error occurred!&quot;</span>);\n    }\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span>(NullReferenceException ex){\n        Console.WriteLine(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Null error occurred!&quot;</span>);\n    }\n}</code></pre></div>",
